;SEQUENCE
The sequence of the protein was not deposited
into any sequence database.
Chains E and F are bound ligands pentasaccharide 
bisphosphate alphaKdo-(2-4)-alphaKdo-(2-4)-alphaKdo
-(2-6)-betaGlcN-4P-(1-6)-alphaGlcN-1P to Fab2. 
For the chain F only Kdo trisaccharide visible.
;
